{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-8224af7c8e192846","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# KServe\n2\t\n3\t**Jira component**: KServe\n4\t**Maturity**: Stable (GA)\n5\t**Owning team**: RHOAI Serving\n6\t**Upstream**: kserve/kserve\n7\t**Midstream**: opendatahub-io/kserve, red-hat-data-services/kserve\n8\t**Konflux onboarded**: yes\n9\t\n10\t## Role in the platform\n11\t\n12\tPrimary model serving stack. Deploys models as InferenceService CRs in two modes:\n13\tserverless (Knative + Istio) and raw deployment (plain Deployments/Services, no\n14\tmesh dependency). Raw deployment mode is the recommended path for disconnected\n15\tand edge environments.\n16\t\n17\t## Dependencies\n18\t\n19\t- Serving Runtimes (vLLM, OpenVINO, Caikit) for model execution\n20\t- Service Mesh / Serverless operators in serverless mode only\n21\t- Authorino for token authentication of inference endpoints\n22\t\n23\t## Interfaces\n24\t\n25\t- InferenceService CRD (serving.kserve.io/v1beta1); deployment state is exposed\n26\t  as CR status conditions (Ready, PredictorReady) and Kubernetes events\n27\t- Prometheus metrics per inference endpoint\n28\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-8ca1c42f513e3b4b","agent_id":"a499bb043a75f3f2e","session_id":"06dfd5f6-e298-413b-a31d-879a10490586","uuid":"01ce63ba-5cf7-4342-95c1-19882b212ec2","timestamp":"2026-10-25T17:45:51.413Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-8224af7c8e192846","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Decompose RHAISTRAT-9013"}
